== ExcellentBuyer.xml
== NPC-bot that buys Excellent-grade items from players via
== trade, in exchange for WCoin/WCoinP, gated by which item
== options it accepts and an optional VIP requirement.
== Loaded by GameServer via CExcellentBuyer::LoadXML().
== Modify only if you know what you're doing!
============================================================

### ExcellentBuyer::Config::Bot ###
	Index         0-29, fixed (MAX_EXCELLENT_BUYER).
	Class         eClass value (see Item.h).
	Enabled       1 = this bot spawns. 0 = skipped.
	ColorName     PK-level color tint applied to the bot's name (0-7).
	Rate          Base success rate (%) used by the buy roll.
	Name          Bot's display name, max 10 characters.
	Map/X/Y/Dir   Spawn location.
	OnlyVip       1 = requires AccountLevel > 0 (VIP) to use.
	WCoinCMin/
	WCoinCMax     Random WCoinC payout range per accepted item.
	WCoinP        Fixed WCoinP payout per accepted item.
	AllowLevel    1 = the item's +Level counts toward acceptance.
	AllowOpt      1 = the item's Excellent option count counts.
	AllowLuck     1 = the item's Luck option counts.
	AllowSkill    1 = the item's Skill option counts.
	AllowExc      1 = Excellent-grade items are accepted at all.

	Child <Equipment> - up to 9 <Item> slots (0-8: 0=Sword 1=Shield
	2=Helm 3=Armor 4=Pants 5=Gloves 6=Boots 7=Wings 8=Pet) worn by the
	bot for its visual appearance only. Type/Index match Item.xml's
	Section/SubIndex; Level is the item's +Level; Opt is its excellent
	option value.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<ExcellentBuyer>
	<Config>
		<Bot Index="0" Class="2" Enabled="1" ColorName="0" Rate="100" Name="ExeBuyer" Map="0" X="138" Y="144" Dir="3" OnlyVip="0" WCoinCMin="1" WCoinCMax="100" WCoinP="0" AllowLevel="1" AllowOpt="1" AllowLuck="1" AllowSkill="1" AllowExc="1">
			<Equipment>
				<Item Slot="2" Type="7" Index="46" Level="15" Opt="7" />
				<Item Slot="3" Type="8" Index="46" Level="15" Opt="7" />
				<Item Slot="4" Type="9" Index="46" Level="15" Opt="7" />
				<Item Slot="5" Type="10" Index="46" Level="15" Opt="7" />
				<Item Slot="6" Type="11" Index="46" Level="15" Opt="7" />
				<Item Slot="7" Type="12" Index="166" Level="15" Opt="7" />
			</Equipment>
		</Bot>
	</Config>
</ExcellentBuyer>
